5,1,1,talk,Servas,,It is a pleasure to be with you all. Let us look for a project that is not only brilliant in theory but sustainable in practice.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Midori,,Hello everyone. I agree. I am particularly interested in how the funding is actually utilized these days to ensure the winner can truly succeed.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Kenji,,Hi! I'm excited to help! I want to make sure the shared tools and facilities are actually ready for a big new project.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"A pleasure, indeed. I suspect the devil is in the details of the infrastructure. I'd like to see where the actual bottlenecks occur.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I believe we should be cautious about overestimating potential. I will be looking for evidence of actual delivery.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Servas,,Wisdom comes from knowing who is standing beside us. I shall focus on the human element of these proposals.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Servas, that is a lovely point. I think understanding the cost of support staff will be very helpful for my concerns.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Midori, that sounds cool! I'm going to check on the shared facility bookings to see if they are too crowded.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Kenji, a practical approach. I shall investigate the logs and schedules to see if the science is being delayed by bureaucracy.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
